  <p>And therefore one must separate <em>Chalah</em> — which is <em>reishis</em> — which is the aspect of the wholeness of the holy tongue (<em>shleimus leshon hakodesh</em>), which is also <em>reishis</em> as mentioned above [in Hilchos Bechor Beheimah Tehorah, Halacha 1]. For with the holy tongue the world was created, and through this the evil that grips there — from the aspect of the Tree of Knowledge — is subdued as mentioned.</p>

