  <p>And therefore the essential [obligation of] <em>Chalah</em> is in the Land of Israel — for the Land of Israel is the aspect of the holy tongue as mentioned. But outside the Land (<em>chutz la'aretz</em>), which is the land of the nations (<em>eretz ha'amim</em>), that is the aspect of the languages of the nations (<em>leshonos ha'amim</em>).</p>

