       ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <p>Therefore one does not give the <em>Chalah</em> to the Kohen [outside the Land] — for there it is impossible to connect the letters of speech (<em>osiyos hadibur</em>) to the <em>chochmah</em>, which is the aspect of the Kohen as mentioned.</p>

