  <p>And therefore five species are obligated in <em>Chalah</em> — corresponding to the <em>heh</em> [five] of <em>da'as</em> (<em>bivchinas heh hada'as</em>) — as is brought in the words of our master, may his light shine (<em>Rabbeinu nero ya'ir</em>). For the essential <em>da'as</em> comes through the aspect of <em>chesed</em> and <em>gevurah</em>.</p>

